i class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Uses </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="inline-markdown InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">llama3.1</span><span> for the LLM.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Uses </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="inline-markdown InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">nomic-embed-text</span><span> for embeddings.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Creates a persistent </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>ChromaDB</span></strong><span> store.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Defines the shared </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="inline-markdown InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">Statement</span><span> structure your agents can use.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Saves statements to JSON.</span></li></ul><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>There is just </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>one small cleanup</span></strong><span>:</span></p><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-markdown-copy="code-block" class="relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip contain-inline-size rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle bg-secondary-soft-alpha Surface-dfq13n dark @container" data-theme="dark" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-XvAQxh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.46951 6.27289C4.68734 5.97727 5.10354 5.91356 5.3992 6.13129C5.69464 6.34921 5.75762 6.76637 5.53982 7.06195L3.32791 10.0639L5.5369 13.0131C5.75668 13.3071 5.69695 13.7237 5.40311 13.9438C5.10923 14.1637 4.69261 14.1037 4.47244 13.81L2.04178 10.5639C1.82214 10.2704 1.8206 9.86789 2.03787 9.57269L4.46951 6.27289Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M14.6053 6.13129C14.