<span>findings.json</span>
<span>reality.json</span></span></code></div></div></div><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>If you intentionally moved those into </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="inline-markdown InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">demo_outputs/</span><span>, that's perfectly fine. Git is simply seeing:</span></p><blockquote class="Blockquote-EqEEot" dir="auto"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>old files deleted + new folder created</span></p></blockquote><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>That can be committed together.</span></p><h3 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>Don't run </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="inline-markdown InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">git add .</span><span> yet</span></h3><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Before we commit everything, run these two commands:</span></p><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-markdown-copy="code-block" class="relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip contain-inline-size rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle bg-secondary-soft-alpha Surface-dfq13n dark @container" data-theme="dark" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-XvAQxh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.46951 6.27289C4.68734 5.97727 5.10354 5.91356 5.3992 6.13129C5.69464 6.34921 5.75762 6.76637 5.53982 7.06195L3.32791 10.0639L5.5369 13.0131C5.75668 13.3071 5.69695 13.7237 5.40311 13.9438C5.10923 14.1637 4.69261 14.1037 4.47244 13.81L2.04178 10.5639C1.82214 10.2704 1.8206 9.86789 2.03787 9.57269L4.46951 6.27289Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M14.6053 6.13129C14.9009 5.9136 15.3171 5.97728 15.5349 6.27289L17.9666 9.57269C18.1837 9.86787 18.1823 10.2705 17.9627 10.5639L15.532 1